Rule 3 (axis tensor must not contain duplicate indices)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ v_2 ≠ null ∧ v_2.len ≥ 1 ∧ v_2.len ≤ ndim(v_1) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : v_2[i] ≠ v_2[j] ∧ i ≠ j
